  de-TeX, so a reader typing `sqrt` matches `\sqrt`.
- **Corpus loading is memoised** (`web/lib/library-cache.ts`), which took a page
  view from ~50 ms of re-parsing 1,204 items to 0.50 ms. The DATA is cached and
